@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 35
skinparam state {
 BackgroundColor white
 BorderColor black
 StartColor black
 EndColor black
}
top to bottom direction

state "草稿" as Draft
state "已签署" as Signed
[*] --> Draft : 建立当次病历\n[同患者唯一就诊]\n/ 保留本次记录来源
Draft : 牙医保存检查及诊断 [权限与版本有效]\n/ 草稿、所见及健康复核共同保存
Draft --> Signed : 牙医确认签署 [必需内容齐全，\n归属、权限与所据版本有效]\n/ 保存签署依据，冻结正文及所见
Signed : 牙医签署独立补充 [原病历已签署]\n/ 另存内容、原因、人和时间，不改原文

@enduml
